s Session Summary:\n# Continuation Summary\n\n## 1. Outstanding User Requests\n\n### Audiobook Niche Evaluation Prompt — STATUS: IMPLEMENTATION (COMPLETE, AWAITING USER ACTION)\n- User wants to evaluate whether an audiobook/book summary YouTube channel is viable\n- An 8-question prompt was crafted for vidIQ AI Coach, saved in artifact `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\41ca2d2f-d653-4452-b469-a994d6d476f7\\audiobook_niche_prompt_review.md`\n- **User's next action:** Paste prompt into vidIQ AI Coach → verify channels with NexLev → bring data back for analysis\n- The agent's next action is to cross-check vidIQ's response for hallucinations, do copyright risk analysis, and give final verdict\n\n### Audiobook Idea Saved to Readme — STATUS: IMPLEMENTATION (COMPLETE)\n- User asked to save the audiobook channel idea into the readme folder so future conversations pick it up\n- Saved in `knowledge/channels.md` under \"Audiobook / Book Summary Channel (Under Evaluation — Sept 2026)\"\n- Committed to git: `559a897`\n\n### Thumbnail Workflow Enforcement — STATUS: IMPLEMENTATION (COMPLETE)\n- User's idea: \"tell vidIQ to find all the outlier videos on the same topic, extract their thumbnails, and fully reverse-engineer everything so I can recreate them\"\n- Created enforced rule at `knowledge/thumbnail_workflow.md`\n- Added to `CONTEXT.md`, `priyanshu-agent.md` key files table\n- Committed to git: `559a897`\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n\n### Critical Corrections\n- **EnglishAvenuee (@EnglishAvenuee) is NOT AI-generated.** User explicitly corrected this: \"And you wrote like this English Avenue channel is AI-generated. It's not, man.\" It uses real human voiceover with simple captions on whiteboard/background images. Very minimal production but earns ~$15k/month.\n- User's actual question about EnglishAvenuee: \"If something this simple (human-made) earns $15k, can I replicate this format using AI tools?\"\n\n### User's Audiobook Channel Plan\n- Content: Book summaries (